    "StikDebug isn't meant to enable JIT for LiveContainer manually. Select StikDebug in LiveContainer settings, enable \"Run with JIT\" for your app, then open your app normally. It will automatically jump back here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikDebug isn't meant to enable JIT for LiveContainer manually. Select StikDebug in LiveContainer settings, enable \"Run with JIT\" for your app, then open your app normally. It will automatically jump back here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikDebug 不应该手动为 LiveContainer 启用 JIT，正确的启动方式应该是在 LiveContainer 设置中选择 JIT 启用器为 StikDebug，然后在应用设置中启用 “使用 JIT 运行”，之后正常打开应用，它会自动跳转到 StikDebug 。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikDebug 不適合手動為 LiveContainer 啟用 JIT。請在 LiveContainer 設定中選擇 StikDebug，為你的 App 啟用「Run with JIT」，然後照常打開 App，它會自動跳回這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable JIT for StikDebug?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
